    "ttsDescriptionOutput": "[fde047]Archivist Staff[-]
[sup](A8, Spell Amplifier)[/sup]
[f472b6]Battleborn[-]
[sup]If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken
at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+,
it stops being Shaken.[/sup]
[f472b6]Fearless[-]
[sup]When a unit where most models have this rule fails a
Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as
passed instead.[/sup]
[f472b6]Hero[-]
[sup]Units within 6'' of friendly Heroes may use the Hero's
Quality for Morale Tests as long as the Hero isn't
Shaken.[/sup]
[f472b6]Spell Amplifier[-]
[sup]Gets +1 to casting rolls.[/sup]
[f472b6]Tough (18)[-]
