it stops being Shaken.[/sup]
[f472b6]Fearless[-]
[sup]When a unit where most models have this rule fails a
Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as
passed instead.[/sup]
[f472b6]Hero[-]
[sup]Heroes with up to Tough(6) may deploy as part of one
multi-model unit without another Hero, but must use
the unit's Defense until all other models have been
