[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Explorer[-]
[sup]Once per game, the Hero and its unit ignore the
effects of Difficult and Dangerous terrain.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Leader[-]
[sup]The Hero and its unit get +1 to Morale Test rolls in
