at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+,
it stops being Shaken.[/sup]
[f472b6]Fearless[-]
[sup]When a unit where most models have this rule fails a
Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as
passed instead.[/sup]
[f472b6]Reliable[-]
[sup]Attacks at Quality 2+.[/sup]
[f472b6]Scout[-]
[sup]May be set aside before deployment. After all other
units are deployed, may be deployed anywhere fully
within 9'' of their deployment zone, over 9'' away from
non-Scout enemy units. Players alternate in placing
Scout units, starting with the player that activates next.[/sup]
[f472b6]Smash[-]
[sup]When attacking units over half of this weapon's range
away, the target must re-roll unmodified Defense
results of 6.[/sup]
[f472b6]Stealth[-]
[sup]When units where most models have this rule are shot
from over 9'' away, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls.[/sup]
[f472b6]Strider[-]
[sup]May ignore the effects of Difficult terrain.[/sup]
[f472b6]Takedown[-]
[sup]This model may pick any model in the target unit as
its individual target for this weapon's attacks, which
is resolved as if it was a unit of [1]. Takedown
attacks must be resolved before other weapons.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Fast Learner[-]
[sup]May pick any other trait from the list.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Resilient[-]
[sup]Gets +1 to Defense rolls when blocking hits.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Elite[-]
[sup]May re-roll one roll of any kind once per game.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Headstrong[-]
[sup]Gets +1 to rolls when taking Morale Tests.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Specialist[-]
[sup]Gets +1 to hit rolls when in melee or when shooting
(pick one).[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Agile[-]
[sup]Moves +1'' on Advance and +2'' on Rush/Charge actions.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign XP: 10[-]",
    "ttsNameOutput": "[b]Pathfinder Snipers[/b]
[ef4444][b]Q4[/b]+[-] / [0ea5e9][b]D4[/b]+[-]",
    "unit": "Pathfinder Snipers",
  },
