[fde047]Hand Weapon[-]
[sup](A3)[/sup]
[f472b6]Anti-Cover[-]
[sup]This weapon ignores Cover.[/sup]
[f472b6]Assault[-]
[sup]Counts as both a ranged weapon and a melee weapon.[/sup]
[f472b6]Battleborn[-]
[sup]If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken
at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+,
it stops being Shaken.[/sup]
[f472b6]Fearless[-]
[sup]When a unit where most models have this rule fails a
Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as
passed instead.[/sup]
[f472b6]Hero[-]
[sup]Heroes with up to Tough(6) may deploy as part of one
multi-model unit without another Hero, but must use
the unit's Defense until all other models have been
killed. The Hero's unit, and units within 6'' of
friendly Heroes with Tough(9) or higher, may use the Hero's
Quality for Morale Tests as long as the Hero isn't Shaken.[/sup]
[f472b6]Reliable[-]
[sup]Attacks at Quality 2+.[/sup]
[f472b6]Tough (3)[-]
[sup]This model must take X wounds before being killed. If
a model with Tough joins a unit without it, then it
is removed last when the unit takes wounds. You must
continue to put wounds on the Tough model with most
wounds in the unit until it is killed, before starting
to put them on the next Tough model (Heroes must be
assigned wounds last, even if already wounded).[/sup]
[f472b6]Versatile Expert[-]
[sup]When this unit is activated, pick one effect: until
the end of the activation all models with this rule in
this unit either get AP(+1) when attacking, or get
+1 to hit rolls when attacking.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Mastermind[-]
[sup]Once per game, when the Hero's unit is targeted by an
enemy, it may force the enemy to re-roll one roll of
any kind.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Berserker[-]
[sup]Once per game, the Hero and its unit may ignore
becoming Fatigued.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Suppressor[-]
[sup]The Hero and its unit get AP(+1) when using Hold and
shooting.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Explorer[-]
[sup]Once per game, the Hero and its unit ignore the
effects of Difficult and Dangerous terrain.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Leader[-]
[sup]The Hero and its unit get +1 to Morale Test rolls in
melee.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Herbalist[-]
[sup]The Hero and its unit get +1 to Defense rolls in
melee.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Dead[-]
[sup]Remove the Hero from your army.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Lucky Break[-]
[sup]May pick any other trait from the list.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Toughened[-]
[sup]Gets Tough(+3).[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign Trait - Crazed[-]
[sup]Gets +1 to hit rolls in melee when charging.[/sup]
[a55eea]Campaign XP: 20[-]",
    "ttsNameOutput": "[b]Veteran Master Brother[/b]
[ef4444][b]Q3[/b]+[-] / [0ea5e9][b]D3[/b]+[-]",
    "unit": "Veteran Master Brother",
  },
]
`;

