          "description": "Prime Warriors embody the strength and determination of the Hive, guiding their fellow Hivers at the forefront of work and warfare. They are most easily spotted by their horns, which serve to amplify their psychic sensitivity, allowing them to pick up distant signals and pass on orders from the Hive Lords, even when operating far away.",
