    {
      "aliasedRuleId": null,
      "coreType": null,
      "description": "Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 30\\" and in line of sight of this model and roll one die, on a 4+ place a token on it. Friendly units may remove tokens from their target before rolling to hit to get +X to hit rolls when attacking, where X is the number of removed tokens.",
