        "name": "Frog-Mage",
        "notes": null,
        "product": {
          "avatarImageUrl": "army-books/unitProduct/BubhE1kUpgYbqZvW/s4zhtZ1Umgx88frMh_EM-.png",
          "description": "Frog-Mages are imposing figures, reigning over the rest of their society as semidivine figures. Saurian legends speak of a time before time when the Frog-Mages walked among the gods and wielded an immense power capable of shaping peoples and Planes to the dictates of fate. Their long slumber has left them greatly diminished; their memories are fragmented, their powers a mere shadow of what they once were, and their bodies so frail that they are confined to palanquins. Yet, even in this state, they still possess a powerful command of the arcane.",
