        "product": {
          "avatarImageUrl": "army-books/unitProduct/BubhE1kUpgYbqZvW/JgklfLdbtPVtT_p-ZIkxx.png",
          "description": "When the Frog-Mages set out to war, Saurian Warriors often make up the bulk of their formation. Warriors are typically not professional soldiers but rather receive their training through communal sporting events and in hunting parties. Usually, they are called up to assist in defending their home or to join in a mission ordained by a Frog-Mage. Saurian Warriors fight fearlessly because they believe that the outcome of the battle has already been determined by fate and their duty is only to carry out their part in the pre-ordained battle honourably, whether it ends in death or victory.",
